    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Has priority over other encumbrances.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) The charge:  (a) is subject to every *encumbrance on the property (other than an encumbrance in which the person referred to in paragraph (1)(a) has an *interest) that came into existence before the charge and that would, apart from this subsection, have priority over the charge; and  (b) has priority over all other encumbrances; and  (c) subject to subsection (2), is not affected by any change of ownership of the property.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(3) The charge:  (a) is subject to every *encumbrance on the property (other than an encumbrance in which the person referred to in paragraph (1)(a) has an *interest) that came into existence before the charge and that would, apart from this subsection, have priority over the charge; and";
